  "speechText": "Node.js runs JavaScript callbacks on the event loop. For a database request, it can wait for the network without blocking that loop, then run the callback when the result is ready. File work and some DNS calls may use the libuv worker pool instead. I watch event-loop lag because heavy JavaScript on the main thread still delays other requests.",
